{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ce5b2e4e2ca968fddcf41a0389572c866f2a74fe2a6824e74c081038e127b477", "ja": "（今日は可奈のレッスン終了後に、\n可奈たっての希望でカラオケ店へとやってきた……）", "zh": "（今天结束可奈的训练后，应她强烈要求来到了卡拉OK店……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "51c4a4cc57599cba3215939a7c886fef24beafe31adf80763ea9105d267de4aa", "ja": "ふんふんふ～ん♪　次はどの曲にしようかな～♪\nどれも素敵だな、迷っちゃうな～♪", "zh": "哼哼哼～♪ 接下来选哪首歌好呢～♪\n每首都好棒啊，真让人纠结～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "dca04584351f8fa95e4964b7d38e01e36076dcdba226663bf7c114ebd52a13ed", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんはどれにします？\nバラード？　ロック？　デュエットも大歓迎ですよ♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生要选哪首？\n抒情歌？摇滚？二重唱也非常欢迎哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e057660c9c7a1413a170445f68501d5460fa4fc7e0cf02a08ff04839ff97a51a", "ja": "俺のことは気にしなくていいよ。\nそれより疲れてないか？　長い時間歌ってるけど……。", "zh": "不用在意我。\n话说回来，你不累吗？已经唱了很长时间了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "9f41cdc1cbe6d6789c4d9255218664b82a16f470e32dd66a07b267212a2382df", "ja": "長い時間って……わっ、もうこんなに経ってる～！？\nうう、ごめんなさーい……。", "zh": "长时间……哇，已经过去这么久了～！？\n呜呜，对不起啦——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1005_p", "source_sha256": "365574358fa6bb91fbdad8eb005612613aa451c0ec3f1c6193c6a08e5df41310", "ja": "いいんだよ。可奈を見てたら、\n途中で止めるのもどうかと思ってね……。", "zh": "没关系的。看着可奈的样子，\n总觉得中途打断你不太好呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "276a5b13f72189910f7f11a4fbe0871c599b29a2bc7b3673b3618de45c1ebf42", "ja": "えへへ、{$P$}さんとのカラオケが\n楽しくて、すっかり時間を忘れちゃってました……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，和{$P$}先生一起唱卡拉OK太开心了，不知不觉就忘了时间……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ce4bf3f739687ea2e8ecb39ed14dbfa815b127d01d630f9323be69ecc4127532", "ja": "楽しんでもらえているなら、なによりだ。\nこっちのことは気にせず、好きなだけ歌ってくれ。", "zh": "只要你能玩得开心，那就再好不过了。\n不用在意我，想唱多久就唱多久吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "cf89abc302d708837a35f14b539d5a9fc3e9961505e1fef3ca9b3be68b3dcb1a", "ja": "うーん……私も休憩しちゃいます！\nちょっとだけお休み～♪　喉もお休み～♪", "zh": "嗯……我也要休息一下！\n稍微休息一会儿～♪ 嗓子也休息一下～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9e04b9b33976ac77e4963f92ee7044fd1e645d89a998f93b4bb89f7568a9550e", "ja": "えっ、いいのか？", "zh": "咦，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "66905d95e85fd6360a78efbe7208dda377ab4f2fce67556085b531a14c625630", "ja": "はい！　せっかくカラオケに来たんですよ？\nやっぱりふたりで一緒に楽しみたいじゃないですか。", "zh": "好的！难得来一趟卡拉OK，不是吗？\n果然还是想和你一起享受其中，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "935cab3a8dac4688e6c79fdf4677b916ab682694d65efc70052845be160498cc", "ja": "歌は、歌いたい時に歌うのが、一番楽しいですから！\nあ、私はいつも歌ってますけど♪", "zh": "唱歌嘛，就是想唱的时候唱，最开心了！\n啊，我可是一直都在唱歌的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1f0a87f91459b940b4b3c41f7f3097b8df9745051b4476f51f125a3846e14ab3", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。でもカラオケなんて久しぶりだから\n数曲ですぐ掠れちゃうな……。さすがアイドルだ！", "zh": "啊，说得也是。不过好久没去唱卡拉OK了，唱几首嗓子就会哑掉……真不愧是偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "bcc8a2d849b26a51ff0e2d562999811a08ed5c1ff4cb1979d18e48d6a267b750", "ja": "えっへん！　私はアイドル、矢吹可奈～♪\nきっと、レッスンの成果かな～♪", "zh": "得意！我可是偶像，矢吹可奈～♪\n一定是训练的成果吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "ca1bbe328d00b4beaba479117c26dbad4655bc0e22b62b554f2a369eb273cb12", "ja": "今日のレッスンでも、「矢吹さんは喉が強い」って。\n歌の先生に褒められちゃいました♪", "zh": "今天的训练课上，声乐老师也夸我说：“矢吹同学的嗓子真厉害。”♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9333748add944250faf09d7cd8e19256061cc2fbc46c81171ad77e7abe6a5aa8", "ja": "おお、すごいな！　可奈は、レッスンもライブも\nちゃんと頑張ってるからな。", "zh": "哦，真厉害啊！可奈不管是练习还是演出，都一直在认真努力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "0a38488c70ae00f84a2b13c5de5a7b29ad5d4dc20b9b65f04737bcd6dd183cc7", "ja": "え、えへへぇ？　そうですかぁ？　どうしたんですか？\n急にそんなに褒められると、照れちゃうな～♪", "zh": "诶、诶嘿嘿？是这样吗？您这是怎么了？\n突然被这么夸，我都害羞了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1017_p", "source_sha256": "44f7ef1ac0601a826dcfc61a28cfb3be1b8e5b43c23bc7a1eec70f59ce6f1382", "ja": "ははっ、そうか。せっかく、リフレッシュにきたんだ。\n仕事のことは考えずに、楽しく過ごそうか。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。难得出来放松一下，就别想工作的事了，开心地度过吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "14113eace1951f10844a762ba628289e674f21c709a8b48b9b85a2ec03fca111", "ja": "はい、そうします！　あっ、でも今は休憩中だし、\n{$P$}さんと色々お話したいです。", "zh": "好的，我会这么做！啊，不过现在是休息时间，我想和{$P$}先生聊聊各种各样的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1019_p", "source_sha256": "333612397b646ff50d8f8fc5579a9d3aa6b8d18711eae215c8a4deb79a6128e7", "ja": "そうか？　もちろん構わないけど……。", "zh": "这样啊？当然没问题，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "fbd25baf97a0056da892d4f05195873ea2d7c263791696462df5cad3cffdb37f", "ja": "{$P$}さんと一緒なら\n話してるだけでも、とっても楽しいですから。", "zh": "只要是和{$P$}先生在一起，\n就算只是聊聊天，也超级开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "9ed90d847fd5fc5a59e99e0c857dd3507e1e1384a23c4a72b180547416137bb2", "ja": "もちろん歌いたくなったら、また歌います♪\nカラオケ休憩～♪　でもでも、歌ってもオッケ～♪", "zh": "当然，想唱的时候就再唱嘛♪  \n卡拉OK休息时间～♪ 不过不过，唱歌也没问题～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0474_1022_p", "source_sha256": "4e6fdf3cc1aed1acfaaac11f31aa7ce08af53ea674050d39ef58fda10794e188", "ja": "（その後、のびのびと歌った可奈は、とても満足げな\n顔をしていた。俺も、いい気分転換になったな！）", "zh": "（之后，可奈尽情地唱了一番，脸上满是满足的神情。我也感觉精神焕然一新了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
